;(Talk to Firefly)
:'''March 7th:''' Does that mean he wants to fight us during the Charmony Festival?
:'''Firefly:''' I'm afraid so.
:'''March 7th:''' This is weird! Aren't arch villains usually plotting some dirty conspiracy in the end? But he actually said something like "in all fairness"... Could it be that he's underestimating us?
:'''Himeko:''' Well, in my opinion, Sunday is deeply committed to his own philosophy and genuinely wants to prove that the Order is right.
:'''Himeko:''' I sensed a strong conviction and a desire for dominance in him. Maybe he won't accept the outcome unless he wins fair and square.
:'''Himeko:''' That's why he'll give it his all in the upcoming battle.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We won't back down either.
::'''March 7th:''' Yeah, you're right! We've even dealt with a Lord Ravager of the Destruction, so a follower of the Order won't be a big deal!
::But he's such a gentleman. If evil, why so nice?
::'''March 7th:''' A&mdash;Are you backing out now!? We've even dealt with a Lord Ravager of the Destruction, so a follower of the Order won't be a big deal!
::I flexed too hard with my swag. Guess I now have to pay my dues, huh...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But he's such a gentleman. If evil, why so nice?
::'''March 7th:''' A&mdash;Are you backing out now!? We've even dealt with a Lord Ravager of the Destruction, so a follower of the Order won't be a big deal!
::I flexed too hard with my swag. Guess I now have to pay my dues, huh...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I flexed too hard with my swag. Guess I now have to pay my dues, huh...
:'''March 7th:''' You...! Every time an important moment arrives, you hesitate.
:'''March 7th:''' We've even dealt with a Lord Ravager of the Destruction, so a follower of the Order won't be a big deal!
:'''Himeko:''' Anyway, we can't leave the Stellaron unchecked. This is about trailblazing a bright future for Penacony and fulfilling Mikhail's and his predecessors' long-cherished wishes.
:{{tx}}
